{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "e8e526b0cceb8e4c0e9e60d056965460331eb177d3bdf6dccb267789b1a55c4c", "ja": "Film 02　月日", "zh": "Film 02　月日", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8e229e1fe573ee47c14d24c93b2cccab8f106e9f7c99c07069868ed491717fbf", "ja": "バンドとしてのブランクを心配する3人だが\n2週間ぶりの合同練習は思いの外スムーズに\n進む。練習後、プロデューサーは皆を新しい\nライブハウスへと見学に連れていく。すっか\nり様変わりした景色に、3人は感慨に耽る。", "zh": "作为乐队，担心空白期的3人\n在时隔2周后的合练中，意外地顺利\n进行着。练习结束后，制作人带大家去参观新的\nLive House。面对焕然一新的景色，3人陷入了感慨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "826f31955870d280fc3ce519d659afefda6db5d3855cd1c8620ed62b5cd647a1", "ja": "（ライブに向けたレッスン、初回から2週間……\n今日は久々に、『≡君彩≡』3人揃ってのレッスンだ）", "zh": "（为了演出进行的训练，从第一次开始已经过了2周……今天是难得一次，《≡君彩≡》3人齐聚一堂进行训练）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "57a8dfaaaa6e9ccb0ec255e9ccdcef3a23b95dd513e7dc3df08b330cdeaa654b", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……はぁ……！\nお、お疲れさまです～！", "zh": "哈……哈……哈……！\n辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "391f1a4086d0460dbf2cb449a5ff5fbccc268ab2f18af12d7e9ce2a7c4c6df73", "ja": "お、来たな。\nお疲れ様、可奈！", "zh": "哦，来了啊。\n辛苦了，可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "00a28b6e8ae80fcec5ecd2c7e1c0cbe8cc32968390411b6d53cdfd749719fb0b", "ja": "わっ、可奈大丈夫！？　走ってきたの？", "zh": "哇，可奈，你没事吧！？你是跑过来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "e59124132659ca8d66d246878d6e0e88f991b89afdb3883a37e931e77ca747c0", "ja": "前のお仕事が長引いちゃって……えへへ。\n間に合ってよかったです！", "zh": "之前的工作拖得有点久了……嘿嘿。\n能赶上真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "0e172550b5e30fa8a68fa00c227710b25dfc7e6ef6b79c408edeac60aae6ce94", "ja": "お疲れさまです、可奈ちゃん！　アンプとエフェクター\nの準備、バッチリです！　あとはギターだけですよ♪", "zh": "辛苦了，可奈！音箱和效果器的准备都搞定了！接下来只差吉他了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "5ebfa6f4b6db9639173d8288647c0c49a499396964101eabbc6cd0fde320c2d7", "ja": "あわわ、すみません！\nすぐ用意しますね！", "zh": "啊呜呜，对不起！\n我马上准备好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "bca6e605b71c5e7c78b08a02bf97c94209cc8e59253974f0c08c7197143c4ac1", "ja": "いや～、今日もバタバタだね～。", "zh": "哎呀～今天也忙得团团转呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "eb7fa8767c783b21f9ab5ec723f3ae21f7a4c4148bb54030fb8007cfbf21a77d", "ja": "3人で集まれたのも、2週間ぶりですからね……！\nまさか、こんなに集まれないとは思いませんでした。", "zh": "我们3个人能聚齐，也是隔了2周了呢……！\n真没想到，竟然会这么难聚到一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "68203ed889aa8a97e17d2429b5f701773fb3802d9d1cace82704f6e74e50b9a0", "ja": "そうだよな……すまない。\nちょうど、スケジュールが立て込んでいて……。", "zh": "是啊……抱歉。正好最近日程排得很满……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "8096c5a4a4ba22e724501c9703bd3e2a5855a1e645b118e5fd078afd14e60a30", "ja": "謝らないでよ、{$P$}！\n仕事がたくさんあるのは、いいことなんだし。", "zh": "别道歉啦，{$P$}！\n有很多工作不是好事嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "c479add167acac7f2e14bc3dc332b5fe0dc9d2a2e622465acbfe64d3e7b959ec", "ja": "そりゃ、前みたいに3人でガッツリ練習できないのは、\nちょっと寂しいけどね。", "zh": "不过，没法像以前那样和3个人一起痛痛快快地练习，确实还是有点寂寞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "d856db3c62de08b61d866d61e1304e3971ff90652d3eb3971487af139496c487", "ja": "そうですね……。個人練習はやっぱり、\nちょっと味気ないというか、なんというか……！", "zh": "是啊……一个人练习果然还是有点无聊，或者该说……总觉得少了点什么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5080294e2c146258eda7953a452a2cb469a4cbd17fd68a2c76555346c8d2fcc5", "ja": "そうだよな。\nもう少しなんとかできないか、やってみるよ。", "zh": "是啊。\n我会试试看，能不能想办法让它更有意思些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "a9e30d4817a169467f56dce70943651d517d3c509a5b7d2364b882580cb77d83", "ja": "お待たせしました～！\nギター可奈、いけます！", "zh": "让你久等啦～！\n吉他可奈，没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "1bd58b183c1adc3917bc64c0d7b194e99e72982ef240cfbbb448c5e4623f7bae", "ja": "では早速、合わせてみましょう！\nあ、トラックの再生速度はどれくらいにしますか？", "zh": "那么，我们马上合奏看看吧！\n啊，伴奏的播放速度要调到多少呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "4b878539b612fb9aee0545190eeb80da12c2ac77318abd8851ddc5199a9c3d7d", "ja": "えっと……", "zh": "那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "e2c0bdb5c0849221ff1a7b0b59a6884b95b07a83c10ebbb5fc6d2bb68aafd2c0", "ja": "50％で！", "zh": "50％！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "e2c0bdb5c0849221ff1a7b0b59a6884b95b07a83c10ebbb5fc6d2bb68aafd2c0", "ja": "50％で！", "zh": "50％！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "1fdf48a5ec9455872643eb07dfe9ecfba4dd2db98b31baa6b6836ec2b2681ad3", "ja": "は、はれ……？　できちゃった……。", "zh": "啊、成功……？　竟然做到了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "b27603f11ececd2b5563aaa02dd799cd8ebf34ab31289e1e3070336883354e07", "ja": "うん、できちゃった……。\n亜利沙、今のってホントに50％だよね？", "zh": "嗯，成功了呢……\n亚利沙，刚才那个真的是50％对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "f984c5f9a2b218b70228cf984b13677eb678e88b9d3b66ee8aa49bbf0834caa4", "ja": "は、はいっ！　間違いなく50％です！", "zh": "没、没错！绝对是50％！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "59dab391df6199d8231209142eb38deef3c5fdae4f474542e23efb9f62659818", "ja": "すごいじゃないか！　初ライブの前は、\n25％で合わせるのも大変だったのに。", "zh": "真厉害啊！明明初次公演前，连达到25％都很困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "0860e501845141f8ab96a23d88878df22a92f3bddd58d082b3c29ef47fe95ffc", "ja": "そうそう！　50％で完走できた時なんて、\nもうみんなで感動しちゃってさ。", "zh": "对对！当时能以50％坚持到最后，大家都感动得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "672d942290071bd7dbc016e3aae19e1634191a107b2d4049aff38e883ded73a0", "ja": "あの時の達成感、まさに青春って感じでしたよね！\nそ、それが今や……。", "zh": "那时候的成就感，真的很有青春的感觉呢！\n可、可现在居然……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "2b3bd4da10f32ad08dd95e8868893830c2d9eece6571535219c067f660a5face", "ja": "この感じでいければ、\n個人練習がメインでもなんとかなりそうだな。", "zh": "照这个感觉继续下去的话，就算以个人练习为主，应该也能想办法吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "b095fbe81dae0c064e7a1a4f40aacf5647f4db473827e89f72b135f74135a928", "ja": "そ、そうですね！\nこの調子でいけばきっと……。", "zh": "是、是啊！  \n照这样下去，一定能……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5aa1411e2b0b7ba15d60ec128271e4f3e4cd6e6444ddbba9e9fc0b0b73b1db7c", "ja": "よし、じゃあこのまま時間まで続けよう。\n終わり次第、今日はいいところに連れて行くぞ！", "zh": "好，那我们就保持这个状态练到时间结束吧。\n一结束，今天就带你去个好地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "b8c46aea34095abbbc7d11a7473ce8fd26278aa86add98c21cfdc20dfe5822fe", "ja": "いいところ？", "zh": "好地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "09733cff840025e455ecf789ecee7e8293fac2ef7bfbaa0cce40bbe7e6618aed", "ja": "よし、着いたぞ！", "zh": "好，到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "03cb98d8ac2b2cfc04e32254e6fd27e0df3d820c2238b8c9c7f4cd78a36e6288", "ja": "わぁ……！　綺麗なライブハウスですね！\nはれ？　ここって、もしかして……。", "zh": "哇……！好漂亮的演出场地啊！\n咦？这里该不会是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "f589a7ccafea9541e4c15b77d1af0d7bc79a45f1e19b11beedc9c0afe155249e", "ja": "ああ、元々『庭園』があった場所……\nつまり、今度みんながライブする会場だ。", "zh": "啊，这里原本是有『庭园』的地方……也就是说，是之后大家要举办现场演出的场地。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "37a8fbed7e8ed7b651a09facee54c3d9d292808ee54af9a1261c5235be010e1a", "ja": "は～……こんなふうになったんだ。\n『庭園』とは全然違うカンジだね。", "zh": "哈——……原来变成这样了啊。\n和『庭园』完全是两种感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "66527bb498cdba6e44fb3865a94741c783c3b58a81bc899a1776139cce161303", "ja": "本当に、全部建て替えちゃったんですね。\nということは、ありさたちのサインも……。", "zh": "真的全都重新建造了啊。\n也就是说，亚利沙她们的签名也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "34ebe0c052b9b2837ffd497663f3b2f6f643ec9d09e0c1f2b49fa2563439fea2", "ja": "新オーナーさんも残したかったみたいなんだけど、\nいろいろ難しかったらしくてな……。", "zh": "听说新老板本来也想保留下来，但好像各种原因实在很难办啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "d5ae3e10fdea98602f7357688671326f97b6cc534460960b94fc395be90c798c", "ja": "ですよね……。\nわかってたけど、残念で……。", "zh": "是啊……\n虽然早就知道，但还是觉得很遗憾……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "0721bb3af29a382e6f24827a68c4adeff92cea799ecd71cfe192d52bdc87f56b", "ja": "新オーナーさんから、完成したって連絡を\nもらったから、みんなを連れてきたんだけど……。", "zh": "因为收到了新老板说已经完工的通知，所以我就带大家过来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "931a1b9d5aa14faa68f50b5993f9b5344673b1e1437ec96629e81590cf849e36", "ja": "なんだか、却ってしんみりさせちゃったな。\nすまない……。", "zh": "总觉得反而让气氛变得有些伤感了。抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "64652406e564d1efa51256996c6234d47fb98f0de46456834ed011d4f94dc5d3", "ja": "いやいや！　こんなカッコいいライブハウスで\nライブできるなんて、超嬉しいよ！？", "zh": "才不是！能在这么酷的Live House里演出，\n我超级开心啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1040_028ari", "source_sha256": "8304fbda5e9dc285f1f524234ab48c538656f42f1ae30a7b163bfc34ce260914", "ja": "そうですよ！　ただ、思い出のあの場所が、\nもうなくなっちゃったんだなって思うと、その……。", "zh": "是啊！只是想到那个充满回忆的地方，已经不复存在了，就觉得……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1041_036kan", "source_sha256": "9801173846f33134794896cd6e207a72f20fa26e900f04a8fd776916779a4339", "ja": "……またライブハウスになるんだったら、\n『庭園』を残せなかったんでしょうか。", "zh": "……要是还会做成Livehouse的话，\n就不能把“庭园”留下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "5d036e28d1696a3c66710a68c1d5e52851490552ce9162334c794f6b08397630", "ja": "みんなの気持ちはわかるけど、\n『庭園』は建物の老朽化が激しかったから……。", "zh": "我明白大家的心情，可是『庭园』的建筑老化得太严重了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1043_p", "source_sha256": "2361312afcfe08a82de21781687053ce4c878d80e6b96a9bae9853d8d5722ab2", "ja": "代わりと言ってはなんだけど、中はどんなバンドマンも\n羨むような、最新設備になってるって聞いたよ。", "zh": "要说替代方案的话，我听说里面配备了连任何乐队成员都会羡慕的最新设施。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "a6fc6f94d3317dc417ff2a37a6a2ce8fb8f64f20f2841257b2c7d0b73e187528", "ja": "えっ、見たい見たい！\nてか、今日って中も見られたりするの？", "zh": "诶，我想看想看！\n话说，今天可以进去里面参观吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1045_p", "source_sha256": "b0993e3374b98e3261ddd94cc06d3e29d0bc60935265f424df0539ab8c56a217", "ja": "もちろん！　ちゃんと許可を取ってあるよ。", "zh": "当然！我已经拿到许可了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1046_028ari", "source_sha256": "0b172c7a6c354d3b11d45a0b96b622dbd4f5f343479ef7bc9061d73ae854fe81", "ja": "あっ、ありさカメラ持ってきてますよ！\n会場の記録ならお任せくださいっ♪", "zh": "啊，亚利沙把相机带来了哦！\n会场记录就交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1047_p", "source_sha256": "ea72de015f435e1db12655629a3e7fc1280f7405cead0ff5affa3bfef6527cec", "ja": "よし、じゃあさっそく入ろう！\n可奈も大丈夫か？", "zh": "好，那我们这就进去吧！\n可奈也没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_02_1048_036kan", "source_sha256": "886e3864d12f63dc79febc6d37f93d7b2d61fe29a9c801af28e1c4725541010a", "ja": "は、はい！　大丈夫です！\nライブハウス～♪　要チェックです～♪", "zh": "是、是的！我没问题！\nLive House～♪ 绝对要好好看看～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
